{"id": "balboa-park-fee-appropriations-await-transfer", "title": "Balboa Park budgeted five transfers as its fee pipeline dried up", "seconds": 47.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.041, "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "2c197bb417679f0d", "words": 144, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "This is an investigative lead about Balboa Park’s infrastructure fees.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.46, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "happens", "when", "no", "fee-paying", "projects", "are", "in", "the", "pipeline?"], "sub": "A ten-year revenue forecast and a list of actual projects answer different questions", "source": "projection"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.35, 0.46, 1.13, 1.37, 1.6, 2.03, 2.32, 2.87]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A city capital plan estimated $0.4 million over ten years.", "t0": 3.58, "t1": 7.38, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "projection", "layout": "table", "heading": "Ten-year fee projection", "context": "Capital Plan FY2026–35", "rows": [{"label": "Balboa Park", "value": "$0.4 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.33, 0.69, 1.02, 1.48, 1.78, 2.03, 2.29, 2.57, 2.94, 3.16, 3.36]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By January 2026, Planning saw no project in the pipeline expected to pay this fee.", "t0": 7.6, "t1": 12.23, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pipeline", "kicker": "Five appropriations were still waiting for transfers", "text": "The January 2026 pipeline", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.6, 0.83, 1.83, 2.2, 2.39, 2.55, 2.95, 3.05, 3.14, 3.57, 3.97, 4.04, 4.2, 4.36]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "At the same time, five appropriations totaling $236,187 were waiting to be transferred.", "t0": 12.35, "t1": 19.19, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "pipeline", "layout": "table", "heading": "Five appropriations awaiting transfer", "context": "January 2026 Balboa Park plan", "rows": [{"label": "Complete streets", "value": "$84,000"}, {"label": "Child care", "value": "$60,000"}, {"label": "All five appropriations", "value": "$236,187"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.21, 0.46, 1.18, 1.44, 2.19, 2.58, 2.79, 3.1, 3.61, 4.35, 4.58, 4.87, 5.43, 5.78, 5.92, 6.17, 6.26, 6.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They included transit, streets, recreation, child care and administration.", "t0": 19.31, "t1": 22.94, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pipeline", "kicker": "Five appropriations were still waiting for transfers", "text": "Where the appropriations were directed", "mark": "Where"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.98, 1.46, 2.12, 2.44, 2.75, 2.88]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Controller reported only one payer in six fiscal years.", "t0": 23.06, "t1": 25.55, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "register", "kicker": "One payer supplied all fee revenue in six fiscal years", "text": "One payer across six fiscal years", "mark": "One"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.46, 0.82, 1.03, 1.2, 1.42, 1.52, 1.72, 2.06]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "After fiscal 2020, the account collected no new fees for five straight years.", "t0": 25.67, "t1": 29.85, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "register", "layout": "table", "heading": "Fee revenue", "context": "Controller account", "rows": [{"label": "FY2019–20", "value": "$33,996"}, {"label": "Five fiscal years", "value": "$0"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.68, 0.95, 1.61, 1.77, 2.06, 2.48, 2.65, 2.82, 3.11, 3.27, 3.51, 3.77]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "With interest, the fee account closed at $116,828.", "t0": 29.97, "t1": 34.67, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "register", "kicker": "One payer supplied all fee revenue in six fiscal years", "text": "The FY2024–25 closing balance", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.77, 0.93, 1.13, 1.45, 1.9, 2.03, 2.23, 2.52, 2.94, 3.45, 3.64, 3.84, 4.19]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Meanwhile, the neighborhood saw a 131-unit affordable housing development and completed transit improvements.", "t0": 34.89, "t1": 40.32, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "delivery", "layout": "table", "heading": "Completed improvements", "context": "Balboa Park Station Area Plan", "rows": [{"label": "Ocean Avenue Corridor Design", "value": "2016"}, {"label": "Kapuso affordable housing", "value": "September 2023"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.57, 0.98, 1.15, 1.24, 1.39, 1.64, 2.39, 2.8, 3.09, 3.75, 4.03, 4.4, 4.73]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The transfer history would show which of the five appropriations eventually reached their programs.", "t0": 40.44, "t1": 44.7, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pipeline", "kicker": "The neighborhood received completed improvements despite the fee constraint", "text": "The missing transfer history", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.53, 0.84, 1.01, 1.27, 1.49, 1.58, 1.68, 1.93, 2.71, 3.15, 3.42, 3.58]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 44.82, "t1": 46.71, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.34, 0.43, 0.5, 1.02, 1.21, 1.3]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A ten-year revenue forecast and a list of actual projects answer different questions", "b": "Five appropriations were still waiting for transfers", "o": "The neighborhood received completed improvements despite the fee constraint"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "timeline"}